        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carney%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The station featured a 1,544‑foot siding and a bay window depot that helped move produce and supplies.",
